      "description": "The rootless rig: which execution mode new workloads use, the shared hvf\n machine's state and lifecycle, and its versioned payload (VMM, kernel,\n initrd, guest tools). The machine is the one MICROPOD_HVF_ROOT names for\n the API process. The REST routes under /v1/rig answer the same data."
    }
